# Auto Email Campaign schedule, run by supercronic in the `campaign` compose service.
# Times are in the container's TZ (Asia/Kolkata). Each job takes its own Postgres
# advisory lock and exits if another run holds it, so overlapping runs are harmless.
# Add --dry-run to a line to watch it without writing anything.

# prepare: every 30 minutes. Milestone 1: intake only.
*/30 * * * * cd /app && python -m campaign.jobs prepare

# housekeeping: 02:00 IST. Milestone 1: reconciliation only; the rest is a stub.
0 2 * * * cd /app && python -m campaign.jobs housekeeping
